# Packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
# Generated specs stay out, but DataForge.spec is hand-written and is the
# only record of how the app is packaged — data-file mapping, why onedir,
# what is excluded. Losing it means rediscovering all of that.
*.spec
!DataForge.spec

